sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Farmer
  actor Agronomist
  participant UI as Web / Mobile UI
  participant API as Flask API
  participant AI as Disease Predictor
  participant Advice as Advice Engine
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Farmer->>UI: Upload leaf photo and optional field context
  UI->>API: Request bilingual screening
  API->>AI: Quality gate and calibrated classification
  alt Photo quality is insufficient
    AI-->>API: retake_required + quality issues
  else Evidence can be screened
    AI-->>API: condition evidence + uncertainty metrics
  end
  API->>Advice: Add language and field context
  Advice-->>API: Human-centred observations and next steps
  API->>DB: Store DiseaseDiagnosis and encrypted evidence
  API-->>UI: Screening result with safety note
  UI-->>Farmer: Explain result, uncertainty, and next action
  Agronomist->>API: Open diagnoses for assigned fields
  API->>DB: Verify FieldAssignment and load permitted records
  DB-->>API: Assigned diagnoses only
  API-->>Agronomist: Review evidence
  Agronomist->>API: Confirm, correct, or mark inconclusive
  API->>DB: Save reviewer decision and audit log
  API-->>Agronomist: Review persisted
